 "id": "3702977489915515", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974670_3702977493248848_1005083544870533286_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KP5n63EruJgQ7kNvwEx04KK&_nc_oc=AdnOwkhcq5W_xUish6_gtBcymcoW2j78w6JwBCw_TJi-nQzyLWzvF6G0mBg_wCQC5iU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftrWmLwP4j5jVFXQ_rf2Lm3aUiYx7bcyTrlcnXW5qyNTg&oe=69A0271D"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot5.png", "id": "1017394309783931", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569452_1017394313117264_5103681682275133887_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UykJmxQY8OkQ7kNvwHCa39e&_nc_oc=Adm38MaAoeHGwFMluVLVa0dwAP2lJIvClLkbw2xNJkW06XOX6RSI_VBByNbg_I9GEZg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftYe1ujdpl21D3bBawEMpNu4lEJht3lH5hQe92Oe62zVQ&oe=69A0390A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Invictus: Men of Iron", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Alpha Test Multiplayer maps\n\n\"Invictus: Men of Iron,\" is a VR experience that throws you into the heart of an arena or battle battle like a real gladiator or spartan.\n\nWhats to come...\n\nFeatures:\n\nEpic Battles: Engage in intense combat scenarios featuring unique factions, each with its distinctive armor and weaponry inspired by ancient cultures. Dynamic Environments: Fight in varied and breathtaking landscapes, from rugged mountains and dense forests to dramatic skies and stormy clouds.\n\nDiverse Warriors: Choose from a range of male and female warriors, each meticulously designed with ornate armor reflecting their cultural heritage.\n\nStrategic Combat: Utilize a variety of weapons, including swords, axes, and master different fighting styles to dominate your enemies.\n\nImmersive VR Experience: swing, block, and dodge mechanics in the works.", "short_description": "Arena Style Multiplayer Hack and Slasher"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://hauntnseek.com/privacy-policy", "develope